WEBVTT

NOTE Tacet product film — captions generated from design/video/voiceover.txt

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Sabine has processed invoices for
twenty-four years.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
She retires Friday. The 2019 process
covers half.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Mira writes its guess before she codes it.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Sabine: Capex. Zero four hundred.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.000
It can't explain that. It waits for a
pause, then asks one question.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Mira: You coded it 0400. What made you do
that?

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Sabine: Equipment over five thousand net
is always capex.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Her answer becomes a rule: before, four
seven one one; now, zero four hundred.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Words aren't proof.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.506
Mira writes unseen invoices, committing to
its answers with a hash — before any

00:00:42.506 --> 00:00:43.000
label.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Two are wrong, both just under the line.
Each miss corrects the map.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Next round, eleven for eleven.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Monday. A new hire follows the 2019 doc.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Mira: Sabine would stop here.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Sabine's rule, in her words — before the
mistake happens.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:09.000
A Work Map she can sign — exportable to
any agent.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:15.000
It learns the part of the job nobody wrote
down.
